%% Collaboration 01: TPS Internal Transfer
flowchart LR
  CustomerApp["Customer App"]
  AuthAPI["Auth API"]
  TPS["TPS Orchestrator"]
  AccountSvc["Account Service"]
  LedgerSvc["Ledger Service"]
  NotifySvc["Notification Service"]

  CustomerApp -->|submit internal transfer| AuthAPI
  AuthAPI -->|forward authenticated request| TPS
  TPS -->|validate source & destination accounts| AccountSvc
  AccountSvc -->|account validation result| TPS
  TPS -->|post debit/credit entries| LedgerSvc
  LedgerSvc -->|posting confirmation| TPS
  TPS -->|publish completion event| NotifySvc
  NotifySvc -.->|delivery status| CustomerApp
